msgid "A convention sees the sign-ups for its editions and the orders placed for them. Conventions are isolated from each other: none of them sees another one’s data."
msgstr "A convention sees the sign-ups for its editions and the orders placed for them. Conventions are isolated from each other: none of them sees another one’s data."

#: src/features/landing/pages/privacy-page.tsx
msgid "A review shows your name, or “anonymous” if you choose so; anonymity holds towards everyone, organizers included. Its comment is public or visible only to the speakers of the programme item, as you choose."
msgstr "A review shows your name, or “anonymous” if you choose so; anonymity holds towards everyone, organizers included. Its comment is public or visible only to the speakers of the programme item, as you choose."

