#: src/features/landing/pages/privacy-page.tsx
msgid "You delete your account yourself in the account settings, after confirming it is you: with your password or with Google, again. Your sign-in methods, sessions, two-factor authentication with its recovery codes, likes, reviews, edition sign-ups and memberships in convention teams go with it. The last head organizer of a convention hands that role over first, so the convention keeps an owner."
msgstr "You delete your account yourself in the account settings, after confirming it is you: with your password or with Google, again. Your sign-in methods, sessions, two-factor authentication with its recovery codes, likes, reviews, edition sign-ups and memberships in convention teams go with it. The last head organizer of a convention hands that role over first, so the convention keeps an owner."

